# Files excluded from the Vercel deployment.
#
# vercel.json sets "outputDirectory": ".", so EVERY tracked file at the repo
# root is uploaded and served at its path — /DEFERRED.md, /tests/…, and so on
# were all publicly readable. This list keeps internal documents and dev
# artifacts off the public site.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded, because the site or the platform needs them:
#   *.html, cosmic-reader.css, assets/, api/, vercel.json
#   package.json / package-lock.json  (kept so Vercel's project detection is
#     unchanged — excluding them risks altering how the deploy is built)
#   README.md  (a public project readme, not an internal document)

# Internal review documents — these enumerate known defects in the app
DEFERRED.md
.impeccable/

# Test sources — run in CI/locally, never needed at runtime
tests/

# Graphify knowledge-graph output: a full structural dump of the codebase
graphify-out/

# Local tooling
deploy.ps1
input.css
.claude/
node_modules/
